From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aphrody-dev <contact@aphrody.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 05:23:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] bunos: committed Arch dependency lists; system distro
 only on dispatch or [distro]

gitlab.archlinux.org PKGBUILD fetches returned nothing inside the CI build (empty package
list), so depends+makedepends are committed under bunos/deps and regenerated by
bunos/deps/regen.sh.
